        "顾一苇",
        "Realistic film-grade character reference photography. Chinese Han ethnicity woman, 22, round face, ponytail, petite, flight-attendant cap never quite straight, standing facing the camera squarely, full body visible head to toe, arms relaxed at sides with hands visible. Black ponytail with a crooked flight-cap crease, round face with soft cheeks, big watery eyes that widen when flustered, small straight nose, petal-soft lips, 22 years old with baby-fat cheeks and no wrinkles, petite 155cm slight build with nervous fidgeting hands Wearing plain simple underwear only, no clothing, no accessories, no jewelry. True skin texture with natural fine lines and visible pores, matte skin finish, no oily sheen, natural unretouched complexion. Seamless pure white studio background, nothing else in frame; soft top key light with gentle twin side fill and a subtle hair rim light, soft lighting ratio. 8K ultra-realistic, commercial portrait photography, 85mm f1.8 lens, subtle film grain, cinematic atmosphere, clean transparent image with rich detail. (avoid: over-smoothed waxy plastic skin, beauty-filter face, distorted facial features, deformed hands, twisted limbs, cartoon, anime, oil painting, illustration)",
